"1635067911.189600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xLC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"72f2e4e1-053f-4763-9549-516650ec629c","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"これでそこが壊れるのは変な気がするけど、以前に何か壊したかな…","ts":"1635067750.188700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"u+++U"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9e5d74d7-13c8-45ac-b9ad-f35e5b241c0e","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"辞書登録中に変換を開始して候補を選ぶのはできるようになったっぽいんですが、変換してアルファベットで選ぶように行くより前の段階で変換を確定させると辞書登録が終わってしまうようになりました (伝われ)","ts":"1635067612.188300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Kzu8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e47166e0-b548-4a7c-a10f-b0f473ebec89","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"\u003chttps://github.com/vim-skk/skkeleton/issues/29\u003e これか","ts":"1635066888.186300","attachments":[{"color":"36a64f","fallback":"\u003chttps://github.com/vim-skk/skkeleton/issues/29|#29 辞書登録中に変換をしようとすると、複数候補の表示が辞書登録プロンプトで消される\u003e","id":1,"title":"\u003chttps://github.com/vim-skk/skkeleton/issues/29|#29 辞書登録中に変換をしようとすると、複数候補の表示が辞書登録プロンプトで消される\u003e","text":"```\n# syntax=docker/dockerfile:1.3-labs\n\nFROM thinca/vim:v8.2.3455-ubuntu\n\nRUN apt-get update \\\n \u0026amp;\u0026amp; DEBIAN_FRONTEND=noninteractive apt-get install -y curl unzip \\\n \u0026amp;\u0026amp; curl -sL '\u003chttps://github.com/denoland/deno/releases/download/v1.14.0/deno-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.zip\u003e' -o /tmp/deno.zip \\\n \u0026amp;\u0026amp; unzip -qd /usr/local/bin /tmp/deno.zip \\\n \u0026amp;\u0026amp; rm /tmp/deno.zip \\\n \u0026amp;\u0026amp; mkdir -p $HOME/.vim/pack/test/start/denops $HOME/.vim/pack/test/start/denops-skkeleton \\\n \u0026amp;\u0026amp; curl -sL \\\n        \"\u003chttps://github.com/vim-denops/denops.vim/archive/v2.0.0.tar.gz\u003e\" | \\\n        tar xz --directory=$HOME/.vim/pack/test/start/denops --strip-components=1 \\\n \u0026amp;\u0026amp; curl -sL \\\n        \"\u003chttps://github.com/kuuote/denops-skkeleton.vim/archive/main.tar.gz\u003e\" | \\\n        tar xz --directory=$HOME/.vim/pack/test/start/denops-skkeleton --strip-components=1 \\\n \u0026amp;\u0026amp; mkdir -p /usr/share/skk \\\n \u0026amp;\u0026amp; curl -sL \u003chttp://openlab.jp/skk/dic/SKK-JISYO.L.gz\u003e | zcat \u0026gt; /usr/share/skk/SKK-JISYO.L\n\nCOPY \u0026lt;\u0026lt;VIMRC /root/.vim/vimrc\nimap \u0026lt;C-j\u0026gt; \u0026lt;Plug\u0026gt;(skkeleton-toggle)\ncmap \u0026lt;C-j\u0026gt; \u0026lt;Plug\u0026gt;(skkeleton-toggle)\nVIMRC\n```\n\n```\n$ DOCKER_BUILDKIT=1 docker build -t skkeleton .\n$ docker run --rm -it --name skkeleton -e COLUMNS=\"$(tput cols)\" -e LINES=\"$(tput lines)\" skkeleton\n```\n\n1. 挿入モードで skkeleton を有効にして、適当に変換を行い、辞書登録モードに入る。\n2. 辞書登録モードで漢字変換を行い、4 つ目以降の候補を表示させようとする。\n3. 候補の一覧が一瞬だけ表示されるが、すぐに辞書登録モードのプロンプトが表示されてしまい、候補を選ぶことができない。","fields":[{"title":"Comments","value":"2","short":true}],"mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/vim-skk/skkeleton|vim-skk/skkeleton\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png","ts":1632748687}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hai-small","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Uwj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"09a4dcd2-30c3-48c1-a37e-3257860003a3","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"辞書登録とかで変換してる時に候補選択が出ないやつですね","ts":"1635066862.186000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DKy8X"}]},{"client_msg_id":"92a451e3-255a-420c-ab71-4e968688cfa9","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"これなんだっけ…(忘却の彼方)","ts":"1635066833.185600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"warau","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"I2b"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1b0f1